"entity": {
"name": "Breedon Group PLC",
"description": "Breedon Group Plc is a holding company, which engages in the business of quarrying aggregates and manufacturing and selling construction materials and building products including cement, asphalt, and ready-mixed concrete. It operates through the following segments: Great Britain, Ireland, and Cement. The Great Britain segment includes construction materials and surfacing businesses in Great Britain. The Ireland segment focuses on Island of Ireland. The Cement segment is involved in cementitious operations in Great Britain and Ireland. The company was founded on August 15, 2007 and is headquartered in Breedon on the Hill, the United Kingdom.",
